  "plan_source": "task 010",
  "sheet_prompt": "One illustration of 9 separate characters arranged in 3 rows of 3, evenly spaced across a single seamless background.\nSubject: Two red cherries with green stems and leaves, smiling faces, identical in every cell.\nStyle: glossy 3D render, smooth rounded shapes, shiny plastic-like material, soft studio lighting with bright reflections.\nOutline: none. Draw every character directly on the background with no outline, border, stroke, die-cut edge or halo around it.\nReading left to right, top to bottom, every character is a different moment: a wide range of emotions AND different states of action (standing, walking, running, jumping, sitting, lying down, leaning, reaching, spinning), so no two characters share a pose, a body position or a silhouette:\nCharacter 1: Cherries standing close, holding hands with shy smiles\nCharacter 2: Cherries blushing deeply, looking at each other with adoring eyes\nCharacter 3: Cherries jumping excitedly with arms raised and wide smiles\nCharacter 4: Cherries sitting side by side, leaning heads together tenderly\nCharacter 5: Cherries spinning slowly while holding hands, laughing joyfully\nCharacter 6: Cherries reaching out to touch each other’s cheeks with shy smiles\nCharacter 7: Cherries lying down close together, eyes closed and peaceful\nCharacter 8: Cherries dancing side by side with happy grins and swinging arms\nCharacter 9: Cherries spinning quickly apart with surprised shocked faces\nMake every expression big and readable at small size: exaggerated eyes, eyebrows, mouth and body language.\nConsistency: the same character design, proportions and colours for all 9 characters.\nBackground: a single, seamless, solid pure blue (#0000FF) background covering the whole image in exactly one shade, with no tiled panels, no shading variations, no tint, gradient, vignette or glow, no shadows, no floor, no noise.\nSpacing: every character is full body with a generous empty margin on every side (at least 20% of its own size), clearly separated from the others, none touching or crossing another.",
  "video_prompt": "Animate this illustration sheet as a 3-second clip. Every character performs its own big, highly expressive, cartoon-style animation in place, inside its own cell, showing a wide range of emotions:\n1. Sway gently side to side as if shyly giggling\n2. Pulsate softly as if heartbeats syncing\n3. Bounce up and down rapidly showing excitement\n4. Sway slowly side to side in affectionate balance\n5. Rotate gently in place with light giggles\n6. Extend and retract stems like gentle touches\n7. Breathe slowly as if resting comfortably\n8. Sway arms and bodies rhythmically like dancing\n9. Twist rapidly outward as if startled\nAnimation style: wide emotions, highly expressive faces and bodies, exaggerated squash and stretch, anticipation and follow-through, clear facial animation (eyes, eyebrows, mouth), secondary motion on ears, tails and props, each character on its own rhythm, lively and full of personality. Never a static pose and never only a gentle sway.\nKeep every character inside its own slot of the 3x3 layout; nothing may touch or cross a slot edge, and characters never interact with one another.\nEmpty slots stay empty: do not add any character, object or effect to them.\nStatic camera, no zoom, no pan, no cuts. Keep the one flat pure blue (#0000FF) background exactly as it is, the same shade everywhere: no shadows, no gradient, no noise, no glow.\nKeep each character's design, proportions and colours unchanged and do not add outlines or borders.",
